title: Overview - The Three Repositories (v1.0)

An at-a-glance map of where the v1.0 code lives. Three git repos under `wikilabs/`, layered top-down — the server edition includes the docs edition, which depends on the plugin.

[img[cm-v1-repos.svg]]

!! What each repo is for

; ''editions/custom-markup-server'' (top)
: Node.js wiki server. Brings in TiddlyWeb, filesystem, internals, the tw-mcp server plus advanced-search-plus and link-to-tabs. `includeWikis: ../custom-markup` pulls the docs edition in. Tiddlers saved through the server land under `../custom-markup/tiddlers`.

; ''editions/custom-markup'' (middle)
: The browseable docs + extra vocabularies edition. Ships Fountain, Markdown, Presentation (Reveal.js), color-boxes, html-elements, lists, table, demo vocabs as shadow tiddlers, plus the full documentation set (Vocabulary Engine, Marker Kinds, Marker Fields, examples). Builds to a single HTML file via `tiddlywiki --build index`.

; ''plugins/wikilabs/custom-markup'' (bottom)
: The engine. ''v1.0.0-beta-35'', stability `EXPERIMENTAL`. Contains:
:* ''wikirules/'' — `registry.js`, `marker-block.js` (`cmblock`: glyph / glyph-level / word / list-item), `marker-inline.js` (`cminline`: inline-pair), `yaml.js`, plus `pragmas/` (`\custom`, `\importcustom`, `\debugcustom`, `\debugmarker`) and `markdown-flavour/` (front-matter, newline, table).
:* ''vocabularies/default'' — `°`, `.`, `»`, `›` (block) and `/° °/`, `❮ ❯`, `⠒ ⠶` (inline-pair). Always active.
:* ''vocabularies/legacy-glyphs'' — `´`, `≈`, `¶`. Opt-in for back-compat with v0.x.
:* ''EditorToolbar/'', ''ControlPanel/'', ''ViewTemplate/'' for the editor + summary UI.
:* ''startup/fix-vocab-type.js'' (Node) keeps `text/vnd.tiddlywiki;vocab=...` tiddlers as single `.tid` files on disk.
:* `$:/config/custom-markup/pragma/PageTemplate` bridges every `$:/tags/Pragma` tiddler into every parser via `\importcustom [tag[$:/tags/Pragma]]` (global pragma channel).

